 {:db/doc "Completed or expired quiz/assessment: p < 0.20 -> -1; otherwise max(0, R(1.20 B (p - 0.35) / 0.65)). N is the full assigned question count; C counts correct submissions. Unanswered questions receive no correct credit. Perfect work earns R(1.20 B). Diagnostic placement is a separate policy and does not use this rule." :db/ident :xp-weights/assessment-v1}
 {:db/doc "Completed lesson: if p < 0.50, XP = -1; else if p = 1, XP = R(1.25 B); else XP = R(B min(1, 1.5 p - 0.30)). Use all ordinary question occurrences across the task, not average per-KP accuracy. A failed completed task still receives this formula's award; unfinished tasks receive no final award." :db/ident :xp-weights/lesson-v1}
 {:db/doc "Completed multistep activity: XP = max(-1, R(B (2.25 p - 1))). Count ordinary question occurrences once regardless of answer-field count. Perfect work earns R(1.25 B). The negative floor applies after rounding." :db/ident :xp-weights/multistep-v1}
 {:db/doc "Completed review, in order: p < 0.50 -> -1; p = 1 -> B + 2; p >= 2/3 -> B; otherwise final ordinary question incorrect/skipped -> 0; otherwise R(B p). The final outcome must be known in the partial-credit band. The perfect bonus is additive two XP, not a percentage." :db/ident :xp-weights/review-v1}
